Rick Jones 在 CUBIC v2.3 慢启动讨论中，就 Darwin 引入的延迟确认代码作出历史溯源："Is this Apple's reimplementation of the ACK avoidance heuristics in OSX they used to have in previous versions of MacOS with the Mentat TCP/IP stack? FWIW, HP-UX and Solaris also have ACK avoidance heursistics - they have a Mentat history - although both should be pretty good and neither should hold-off ACKs for two seconds..."——即 Ack 规避启发式源自 Mentat TCP/IP 谱系，Apple 系继承而非原创。同串更早 Injong Rhee 曾引"We tested with FreeBSD. I presume that it covers MacOS"作为跨平台实测依据，并批评"No Darwin added some stupid code that holds off acks for up to 2 seconds"——这两句系 Rhee 提出，非 Jones。BSD 系内核（含 Darwin 血统）被用作 Linux TCP 行为验证基线，但具体引述出自 Rhee。

